  <item>
    <title>乐作043 | 沈爱娃：从音乐剧到艺术教育，和小朋友的互动更让我治愈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678c80069420ede9d112e689</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678c80069420ede9d112e689</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jan 2025 04:51:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp_5XCRTkggZ9Jgxuw2hlVB__-bL.jpeg"></figure><p><span>*本播客开听友群啦！请加主播微信gupansh，备注「乐作」，拉你进群！</span></p><p><span>爱娃是我上外意语的学妹，在上海的音乐剧行业工作几年参与了几个大项目后，去纽约大学读了戏剧管理硕士，回国后从事少儿艺术教育至今，是个非常外向活泼甚至有一丝丝戏精的可爱姑娘哈哈哈。</span></p><p><span>音频摘要：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="417">06:57</a> 做个体户一年半的心得</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="577">09:37</a> 在纽约读的戏剧管理无法适用中国市场</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="606">10:06</a> 留学时上的微观经济课启发最大</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a> 教小朋友写剧非常治愈</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1239">20:39</a> 四岁半遇到了全世界最好的钢琴老师</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1577">26:17</a> 大学为何选择意大利语专业？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a> 学语言更是学习背后的思维体系</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a> 在纽约留学时不小心制作了《我，堂吉诃德》中文版</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> 《百变小樱》让我相信什么事都可以</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2173">36:13</a> 最喜欢听到家长说小孩子因为学琴而变自信</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2406">40:06</a> 我对纽约没那么留恋</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2603">43:23</a> 艺术与教育的核心都是讲故事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2891">48:11</a> 工作中的情绪价值很重要</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3418">56:58</a> 以前我非常逃避冲突</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3502">58:22</a> 相信吸引力法则，相信直觉</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3621">60:21</a> 不要为账户余额焦虑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3836">63:56</a> 想赚钱就别做表演艺术（此处需特别高亮！）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4141">69:01</a> 个体户后爸妈把我当人看了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4262">71:02</a> 创业让我更认识自己</span><br><br><span>提到内容：</span><br><span>《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35942057/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35942057/"><span>看不见的女性</span></a><span>》</span><br><span>《</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/location/drama/10944630/" data-url="https://www.douban.com/location/drama/10944630/"><span>玛蒂尔达</span></a><span>》</span><br><span>阿德勒《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36150914/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36150914/"><span>被讨厌的勇气</span></a><span>》</span><br><span>FIRE 提前退休</span><br><span>《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/30262617/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/30262617/"><span>生命3.0</span></a><span>》</span><br><span>《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35668949/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35668949/"><span>算法的力量：人类如何共同生存</span></a><span>》</span><br><span>《</span><a href="https://yd.qq.com/web/reader/e4532e50813ab907fg013c25" data-url="https://yd.qq.com/web/reader/e4532e50813ab907fg013c25"><span>跟着魏晋名士学发疯</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>嘉宾小红书：@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/56582e60e00dd80d625e6f42" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/56582e60e00dd80d625e6f42"><span>沈爱娃evashen</span></a></p><p><span>场地鸣谢：</span></p><p><span>CPAx丽丰天际播客录音室——CCPA S36中文播客艺术中心（上海市静安区天目西路99号丽丰天际中心）</span></p>]]></description>
