    <guid isPermaLink="false">677e29ad1962f0b7513616af</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 08 Jan 2025 07:41:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Maria是通过另一个播客《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/611e7a487ae2d8cea63787f8" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/611e7a487ae2d8cea63787f8"><span>酸奶哥聊天社</span></a><span>》的线下小规模聚会认识的，2024年3月从新能源汽车裸辞后，她间（玩）隔（乐）至今，目前去了东南亚、欧洲、非洲，2025年会去北美、南美、南极等。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音频摘要：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">04:55</a> 大学毕业后为何选择就职汽车公司？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="791">13:11</a> 裸辞后玩了哪些地方？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 为啥想去非洲做义工？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1403">23:23</a> 在非洲感受到的最大文化冲击？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">48:30</a> 给想去非洲的人有何建议？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3938">01:05:38</a> 在海外遇见的祖国同胞都很好</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>酸奶哥聊天社《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66bcc537db5e6d6bf952ca87" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66bcc537db5e6d6bf952ca87"><span>该省省，该花花，几万块就能环游世界啦！</span></a><span>》《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/649ba549ba16d4cb98336b91" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/649ba549ba16d4cb98336b91"><span>来看大火箭吧，包哭！</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><span>丹麦剧《</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/doubanapp/dispatch/movie/35177082" data-url="https://www.douban.com/doubanapp/dispatch/movie/35177082"><span>我们的家庭</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><span>Maria的小红书：@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5ad06f6211be105fce125927" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5ad06f6211be105fce125927"><span>小肥拉和小特特</span></a><span>，微信视频号：@Maria967</span></p>]]></description>
