  <item>
    <title>乐作041 | Rosalind金晶：从策划执行艺术展，到芳疗塔罗雷诺曼</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674d3fa00ed328720ad87f60</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674d3fa00ed328720ad87f60</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Dec 2024 05:42:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtJLdDz3khIbv5tk3tr-kQtGBGOp.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>封面图是金晶用四张雷诺曼卡牌概括的当下工作：灵、岔路、山、心。</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>金晶是乐作返场最多的嘉宾，时隔第二个四年第二次返场，当然是因为她又换工作啦！丰富的工作内容从长标题中可见一斑。</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>*备注：Yoko Ono的中文名既是小野洋子，也可以是大野洋子。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>节目摘要：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> 关于</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/5f9789d383c34e85dd671727" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/5f9789d383c34e85dd671727"><span>上一期播客</span></a><span>里的茉力娃娃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 策划执行的</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LxPXv513GGi8VVijv9UOmQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LxPXv513GGi8VVijv9UOmQ"><span>Jacky Tsai深圳个展</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1498">24:58</a> 聊聊玛丽娜·阿布拉莫维奇（阿布奶奶）的上海展览</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2062">34:22</a> 大野洋子在伦敦泰特美术馆的回顾展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3340">55:40</a> 艺术家是巫师吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3559">59:19</a> 从芳香到塔罗的多年玄学学习经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5212">01:26:52</a> 为啥去学爵士演唱</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>延伸内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>金晶新开的</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/60155ebb00000000010095d5" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/60155ebb00000000010095d5"><span>小红书</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>金晶做嘉宾的前两期播客：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/5f9789d383c34e85dd671727" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/5f9789d383c34e85dd671727"><span>2020年</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/5e7c67df418a84a046799dab" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/5e7c67df418a84a046799dab"><span>2016年</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Yoko Ono在Tate Modern的展 </span><a href="https://www.tate.org.uk/whats-on/tate-modern/yoko-ono" data-url="https://www.tate.org.uk/whats-on/tate-modern/yoko-ono"><span>www.tate.org.uk</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Marina Abramovic在Ted的演讲</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1v14y1R7yM/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1v14y1R7yM/"><span>视频</span></a></p>]]></description>
