  <item>
    <title>乐作039 | 琥珀Amber与阿逗：做教练前，自己先体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e0e679bfd7110df4c167bb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e0e679bfd7110df4c167bb</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Sep 2024 00:38:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>*本播客开听友群啦！请加主播微信gupansh，备注「乐作」，拉你进群！</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近明显感觉身边灵活就业的人变多了（包括我自己），教练也变多了，不但有健身房的教练，更有人生、情感、金钱教练，这次邀请2位我新认识的教练朋友琥珀和阿逗，一起聊聊教练这件事。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkvyWBefSq42YFW4nqHMLURhAOXX.jpeg"></figure><span></span><h2><span>两位的工作emoji总结</span></h2><span></span><p><span>琥珀Amber：</span></p><span></span><p><span>😉 我理解客户，与客户有默契</span></p><span></span><p><span>💕 我爱世人</span></p><span></span><p><span>👩🏻‍🌾 返璞归真的女孩状态</span></p><span></span><p><span>🧘🏻‍♀️ 人生是修行，让我们一起修行</span></p><span></span><p><span>✨ Amber是宇宙间的一股能量，陪伴你</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿逗：</span></p><span></span><p><span>🙏 正心正念的状态</span></p><span></span><p><span>🤩 时不时总会出现惊喜</span></p><span></span><p><span>🤪 一个轻松愉快的环境</span></p><span></span><p><span>🤔 时不时也会思考和复盘</span></p><span></span><p><span>🤓 对未来充满信心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> 不同教练的方法论基础都类似：利用提问技术，引发来访者思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="577">09:37</a> 觉得人生卡住的时候，该找心理咨询师还是教练？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="796">13:16</a> 教练能给出行动指南吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 如何选择咨询师/教练？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1296">21:36</a> 为何想做教练？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2116">35:16</a> 会被更年长的客户质疑专业能力吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2664">44:24</a> 教练技术有流程吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3168">52:48</a> 印象深刻的客户？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3708">01:01:48</a> 适当暴露脆弱能拉近人与人的距离</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3826">01:03:46</a> 什么样的人适合做教练？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4160">01:09:20</a> 学教练前，最好先体验教练</span></p><span></span><h2><span>提到的书目</span></h2><span></span><p><span>《了凡四训》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《高绩效教练》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《越过山丘》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《直击核心》</span></p><span></span><h2><span>嘉宾：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>琥珀Amber，</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64e0a9d61bff5aa91a906e19" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64e0a9d61bff5aa91a906e19"><span>播客《琥珀知行录》</span></a><span>，微信：Awesome_Amber</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿逗（王焕），微信：wanghuan302</span></p><span></span><p><span>*感谢CCPA中文播客艺术中心提供录音场地</span></p>]]></description>
