  <item>
    <title>乐作038 | Maggie：保险行业靠认知生存</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660540fc2d9eae5d0a9adbc0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660540fc2d9eae5d0a9adbc0</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Mar 2024 10:05:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FguI3ISpwq680MEvNDx95kr-PMLx.jpeg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>Maggie的职场总结emoji：「倾听，沉淀，认可非议，自我发电」</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>认识Maggie不久，契机是因为我要咨询保险，声音很好听的Maggie特别耐心地给我讲了好多保险知识，后来发现她还挺年轻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近保险好像越来越火，有种说法，所有乙方的尽头是卖保险，所以我就找来Maggie录这期播客，聊聊卖保险的一些常识问题，不知道听完之后，你还想不想转行。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>播客提要：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="232">03:52</a> 我自己也曾稀里糊涂买保险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 怎么30岁不到就卖起了保险？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a> 做保险的门槛高吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">23:15</a> 把无底薪的保险当副业能成吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1864">31:04</a> 做保险最有挑战的事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2113">35:13</a> 第三方保险经纪真的是在客观推荐吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2503">41:43</a> 做保险最有成就感的时候？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3243">54:03</a> 对于想改行做保险的人有什么建议？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的采访我爸的播客：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/641555f83e0b18739e65bd8b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/641555f83e0b18739e65bd8b"><span>酸奶哥聊天社《VOL.72 我今年72岁，我要卖掉上海的房》</span></a></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>如果听完本期觉得对味</span></strong></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>我猜你还想认识这几位</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/5e7c67df418a84a046799d9f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/5e7c67df418a84a046799d9f"><span>四大工作10多年的Justin</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/5e7c67df418a84a046799da2" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/5e7c67df418a84a046799da2"><span>学了7年考古却从业金融的Layla</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5e7c67df418a84a046799d95" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5e7c67df418a84a046799d95"><span>在北京做金融，米兰开餐厅的Yuansi</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luPPutFo-Oxxm4b6Gc7LwobmAtAv.m4a" length="84850375" type="audio/mp4"/>
